  "labelNotes": "Columns checked with pdftotext -layout. Operating Ranges print two VCC rows keyed by clock: 'FR = 133MHz, fR = 50MHz' (3.0-3.6 V) and 'FR = 104MHz, fR = 50MHz' (2.7-3.0 V); conditions keep only the distinguishing FR frequency as F (fR = 50 MHz is common to both; judgement call). ICC3 read-current rows take F from the row text 'Dual /Quad 50/80/104MHz' (printed on the line below the values); all three value lines read '(2) | ICC3 | ...', so the citation is not unique. ICC4 (Write Status Register), ICC5 (Page Program), ICC6 (Sector/Block Erase) and ICC7 (Chip Erase) all print 20 TYP / 25 MAX mA with no allowed conditions, so they collapse to one TYP and one MAX label (cited at ICC4). ILI printed '\u00b12' in the MAX column: labelled as 2 uA MAX (not split into -2 MIN). ILO is output leakage, excluded. Abs max: VCC range '-0.6 to 4.6' gives 4.6 ABS_MAX only; VIO/VIOT are VCC-relative expressions, skipped."
